      "writtenOn": "2014-11-20T11:07:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Our original bug report for this states:\n\n\"If a system app in /system/priv-app/ is once updated via Google play and it is moved to /system/app/ by next FOTA, then the app keeps FLAG_PRIVILEGED even after moved to /system/app.\"",
      "parentUuid": "ba5313fc_30938863",
      "revId": "c4ad81e40fe92447dd908179d38b69095fc55a71",
